{"title": "Quadratic Equations (Level 2)", "duration_min": 20.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>Write the equation for (2x-5) (3x+5).</p>", "q_hi": "<p>(2x-5) (3x+5) &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["3x<sup>3</sup> - 2x + 3", "4x<sup>2</sup> + 5x - 5", "5x<sup>2</sup> + 10x - 55", "6x<sup>2</sup> - 5x - 25"], "options_hi": ["3x<sup>3</sup> - 2x + 3", "4x<sup>2</sup> + 5x - 5", "5x<sup>2</sup> + 10x - 55", "6x<sup>2</sup> - 5x - 25"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Given that</p><p>(2x-5) (3x+5)</p><p>= 6x<sup>2</sup> + 10x - 15x - 25</p><p>= 6x<sup>2</sup> - 5x - 25</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Given that</p><p>(2x-5) (3x+5)</p><p>= 6x<sup>2</sup> + 10x - 15x - 25</p><p>= 6x<sup>2</sup> - 5x - 25</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If (2x  -  9)(x + 7) both are factors of mx<sup>2</sup> + nx  -  63, then which of the following is correct?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (2x - 9)(x + 7) &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; mx<sup>2</sup> + nx - 63 &#2325;&#2375; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2344;&#2326;&#2306;&#2337; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["2m = n - 1", "2m = 5n", "m = 2n", "m + 1 = n"], "options_hi": ["2m = n - 1", "2m = 5n", "m = 2n", "m + 1 = n"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>(2x  -  9)(x + 7) = mx<sup>2</sup> + nx  -  63</p><p>=&gt; 2x<sup>2</sup> + 5x  -  63 = mx<sup>2</sup> + nx  -  63</p><p>So, m = 2, and n = 5</p><p>Checking by options:</p><p>(a) 2m = n - 1</p><p>=&gt; 2 * 2 = 5  -  1</p><p>=&gt; 4 = 4 (True)</p><p>(b) 2m = 5n</p><p>=&gt; 2 * 2 = 5 * 5</p><p>=&gt; 4 &#8800; 25 (False)</p><p>(c) m = 2n</p><p>=&gt; 2 = 2 * 5</p><p>=&gt; 2 &#8800; 10 (False)</p><p>(d) m + 1 = n</p><p>=&gt; 2 + 1 = 5</p><p>=&gt; 3 &#8800; 5 (False)</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(2x  -  9)(x + 7) = mx<sup>2</sup> + nx  -  63</p><p>=&gt; 2x<sup>2</sup> + 5x  -  63 = mx<sup>2</sup> + nx  -  63</p><p>So, m = 2, and n = 5</p><p>Checking by options:</p><p>(a) 2m = n - 1</p><p>=&gt; 2 * 2 = 5  -  1</p><p>=&gt; 4 = 4 (True)</p><p>(b) 2m = 5n</p><p>=&gt; 2 * 2 = 5 * 5</p><p>=&gt; 4 &#8800; 25 (False)</p><p>(c) m = 2n</p><p>=&gt; 2 = 2 * 5</p><p>=&gt; 2 &#8800; 10 (False)</p><p>(d) m + 1 = n</p><p>=&gt; 2 + 1 = 5</p><p>=&gt; 3 &#8800; 5 (False)</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following is a quadratic equation?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2367;&#2328;&#2366;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["p(p  -  1) = (p + 7)<sup>2</sup>", "q<sup>3</sup>  -  3q + 4 = (q<sup>2</sup>  -  1)(2q + 1)", "r(5r  -  6) = r<sup>2</sup> + 2", "(s<sup>2</sup>  -  2)<sup>2</sup> = s<sup>3</sup> - 3"], "options_hi": ["p(p  -  1) = (p + 7)<sup>2</sup>", "q<sup>3</sup>  -  3q + 4 = (q<sup>2</sup>  -  1)(2q + 1)", "r(5r  -  6) = r<sup>2</sup> + 2", "(s<sup>2</sup>  -  2)<sup>2</sup> = s<sup>3</sup> - 3"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>a) p(p  -  1) = (p + 7)<sup>2</sup> =&gt; 15p + 49 = 0</p><p>b) q<sup>3</sup>  -  3q + 4 = (q<sup>2</sup>  -  1)(2q + 1) =&gt; q<sup>3</sup> + q<sup>2</sup> + q  -  5 = 0</p><p>c) r(5r  -  6) = r<sup>2</sup> + 2 =&gt; 2r<sup>2</sup>  -  3r  -  1 = 0</p><p>d) (s<sup>2</sup>  -  2)<sup>2</sup> = s<sup>3</sup>  -  3 =&gt; s<sup>4</sup>  -  s<sup>3</sup>  -  4s<sup>2</sup>+ 7 = 0</p><p>Hence, option 'c' is correct.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>a) p(p  -  1) = (p + 7)<sup>2</sup> =&gt; 15p + 49 = 0</p><p>b) q<sup>3</sup>  -  3q + 4 = (q<sup>2</sup>  -  1)(2q + 1) =&gt; q<sup>3</sup> + q<sup>2</sup> + q  -  5 = 0</p><p>c) r(5r  -  6) = r<sup>2</sup> + 2 =&gt; 2r<sup>2</sup>  -  3r  -  1 = 0</p><p>d) (s<sup>2</sup>  -  2)<sup>2</sup> = s<sup>3</sup>  -  3 =&gt; s<sup>4</sup>  -  s<sup>3</sup>  -  4s<sup>2</sup>+ 7 = 0</p><p>Hence, option 'c' is correct.</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following equations has roots 17 and 19? </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; 17 &#2324;&#2352; 19 &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?</p>", "options_en": ["X<sup>2</sup>  -  36X + 313 = 0", "X<sup>2</sup>  -  36X + 393 = 0", "X<sup>2</sup>  -  36X + 293 = 0", "X<sup>2</sup>  -  36X + 323 = 0"], "options_hi": ["X<sup>2</sup>  -  36X + 313 = 0", "X<sup>2</sup>  -  36X + 393 = 0", "X<sup>2</sup>  -  36X + 293 = 0", "X<sup>2</sup>  -  36X + 323 = 0"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>(a) </p><p>313 = Products of roots = 313 * 1 [Not satisfied]</p><p>(b) </p><p>393 = Products of roots = 3 * 131 [Not satisfied]</p><p>(c) </p><p>293 = Products of roots = 293 * 1 [Not satisfied]</p><p>(d) </p><p>323 = Products of roots = 17 * 19 [Satisfied]</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(a) </p><p>313 = Products of roots = 313 * 1 [Not satisfied]</p><p>(b) </p><p>393 = Products of roots = 3 * 131 [Not satisfied]</p><p>(c) </p><p>293 = Products of roots = 293 * 1 [Not satisfied]</p><p>(d) </p><p>323 = Products of roots = 17 * 19 [Satisfied]</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the quadratic equation that has one root is 7 + &radic;9. </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2357;&#2361; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2367;&#2328;&#2366;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; 7 + &radic;9 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["X<sup>2</sup> + 14X + 40 = 0", "X<sup>2</sup> + 14X + 40 = 0", "X<sup>2</sup>  -  14X + 40 = 0", "X<sup>2</sup>  -  14X + 49 = 0"], "options_hi": ["X<sup>2</sup> + 14X + 40 = 0", "X<sup>2</sup> + 14X + 40 = 0", "X<sup>2</sup>  -  14X + 40 = 0", "X<sup>2</sup>  -  14X + 49 = 0"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>One root = 7 + &radic;9 </p><p>Other root = 7 - &radic;9 </p><p>The required quadratic equation = X<sup>2</sup>  -  (&#946; + &#945;) X + &#946;&#945; = 0 </p><p>X<sup>2</sup>  -  (7 + &radic;9 + 7  -  &radic;9) X + (7 + &radic;9) (7  -  &radic;9) = 0 </p><p>X<sup>2</sup>  -  14X + 40 = 0 </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>One root = 7 + &radic;9 </p><p>Other root = 7 - &radic;9 </p><p>The required quadratic equation = X<sup>2</sup>  -  (&#946; + &#945;) X + &#946;&#945; = 0 </p><p>X<sup>2</sup>  -  (7 + &radic;9 + 7  -  &radic;9) X + (7 + &radic;9) (7  -  &radic;9) = 0 </p><p>X<sup>2</sup>  -  14X + 40 = 0 </p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If one root of the equation 2x<sup>2</sup>  -  x = 10 is 2, find the other root.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; 2x<sup>2</sup> - x = 10 &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; 2 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["-3/2", "3/2", "-1/2", "1/2"], "options_hi": ["-3/2", "3/2", "-1/2", "1/2"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Let the other root of the equation be x</p><p>Sum of roots of equation = -b/a</p><p>x + 2 = 1/2</p><p>x = -3/2</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the other root of the equation be x</p><p>Sum of roots of equation = -b/a</p><p>x + 2 = 1/2</p><p>x = -3/2</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>The sum of roots of the equation 4x<sup>2</sup>  -  mx + n = 0 is 20, if one root of the equation is 7/2, then find the value of 'n'.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; 4x<sup>2</sup> - mx + n = 0 &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327; 20 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; 7/2 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 'n' &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["241", "231", "181", "251"], "options_hi": ["241", "231", "181", "251"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Sum of roots of the equation = 20</p><p>m/4=20</p><p>m = 80</p><p>One root of the equation = 7/2</p><p>Now,</p><p>4x<sup>2</sup>  -  mx + n = 0</p><p>4*(7/2)<sup>2</sup>  -  80*7/2 + n = 0</p><p>49  -  280 + n = 0</p><p>n = 231</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Sum of roots of the equation = 20</p><p>m/4=20</p><p>m = 80</p><p>One root of the equation = 7/2</p><p>Now,</p><p>4x<sup>2</sup>  -  mx + n = 0</p><p>4*(7/2)<sup>2</sup>  -  80*7/2 + n = 0</p><p>49  -  280 + n = 0</p><p>n = 231</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If p and q are the roots of equation x<sup>2</sup>  -  15x + 56 = 0, and p is also the root of the equation 3x<sup>2</sup>  -  20x  -  7 = 0, the what is the value of (p - q)?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; p &#2324;&#2352; q &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; x<sup>2</sup> - 15x + 56 = 0 &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2324;&#2352; p &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; 3x<sup>2</sup> - 20x - 7 = 0 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2349;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (p - q) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["1", "2", "-1", "-2"], "options_hi": ["1", "2", "-1", "-2"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  15x + 56 = 0</p><p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  7x  -  8x + 56 = 0</p><p>(x  -  7)(x  -  8) = 0</p><p>x = 7, 8</p><p>3x<sup>2</sup>  -  20x  -  7 = 0</p><p>3x<sup>2</sup>  -  21x + x  -  7 = 0</p><p>(x  -  7)(3x + 1) = 0</p><p>x = 7, -1/3</p><p>p = 7 and q = 8</p><p>p  -  q = 7  -  8 = -1</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  15x + 56 = 0</p><p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  7x  -  8x + 56 = 0</p><p>(x  -  7)(x  -  8) = 0</p><p>x = 7, 8</p><p>3x<sup>2</sup>  -  20x  -  7 = 0</p><p>3x<sup>2</sup>  -  21x + x  -  7 = 0</p><p>(x  -  7)(3x + 1) = 0</p><p>x = 7, -1/3</p><p>p = 7 and q = 8</p><p>p  -  q = 7  -  8 = -1</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following is NOT a quadratic equation?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2367;&#2328;&#2366;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["(x  -  2)<sup>2</sup> = 2x  -  8", "(x + 3)(x  -  5) = (x  -  4)(x + 6)", "(x + 2) (2x  -  3) = x(x  -  5)", "x<sup>3</sup>  -  2x<sup>2</sup> + 3x + 2 = x<sup>3</sup> + (2)<sup>3</sup>"], "options_hi": ["(x  -  2)<sup>2</sup> = 2x  -  8", "(x + 3)(x  -  5) = (x  -  4)(x + 6)", "(x + 2) (2x  -  3) = x(x  -  5)", "x<sup>3</sup>  -  2x<sup>2</sup> + 3x + 2 = x<sup>3</sup> + (2)<sup>3</sup>"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>a) (x  -  2)<sup>2</sup> = 2x  -  8</p><p>x<sup>2 </sup>+ 4  -  4x = 2x  -  8 </p><p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  6x + 12 = 0 (Quadratic)</p><p>b) (x + 3)(x  -  5) = (x  -  4)(x + 6)</p><p>x<sup>2 </sup>+ 3x  -  5x  -  15 = x<sup>2</sup>  -  4x + 6x  -  24</p><p>4x  -  9 = 0 (Not Quadratic)</p><p>c) (x + 2) (2x  -  3) = x(x  -  5)</p><p>2x<sup>2</sup> + 4x  -  3x  -  6 = x<sup>2</sup>  -  5x</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + 6x  -  6 = 0 (Quadratic)</p><p>d) x<sup>3</sup>  -  2x<sup>2</sup> + 3x + 2 = x<sup>3</sup> + (2)<sup>3</sup></p><p>x<sup>3</sup>  -  2x<sup>2</sup> + 3x + 2 = x<sup>3</sup> + 8</p><p>-2x<sup>2</sup> + 3x + 2  -  8 = 0</p><p>2x<sup>2</sup>  -  3x + 6 = 0 (Quadratic)</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>a) (x  -  2)<sup>2</sup> = 2x  -  8</p><p>x<sup>2 </sup>+ 4  -  4x = 2x  -  8 </p><p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  6x + 12 = 0 (Quadratic)</p><p>b) (x + 3)(x  -  5) = (x  -  4)(x + 6)</p><p>x<sup>2 </sup>+ 3x  -  5x  -  15 = x<sup>2</sup>  -  4x + 6x  -  24</p><p>4x  -  9 = 0 (Not Quadratic)</p><p>c) (x + 2) (2x  -  3) = x(x  -  5)</p><p>2x<sup>2</sup> + 4x  -  3x  -  6 = x<sup>2</sup>  -  5x</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + 6x  -  6 = 0 (Quadratic)</p><p>d) x<sup>3</sup>  -  2x<sup>2</sup> + 3x + 2 = x<sup>3</sup> + (2)<sup>3</sup></p><p>x<sup>3</sup>  -  2x<sup>2</sup> + 3x + 2 = x<sup>3</sup> + 8</p><p>-2x<sup>2</sup> + 3x + 2  -  8 = 0</p><p>2x<sup>2</sup>  -  3x + 6 = 0 (Quadratic)</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>What is the square root of the following?</p><p>(X<sup>2</sup> + 26X + 169) (X<sup>2</sup> + 38X + 361) </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2327;&#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p>(X<sup>2</sup> + 26X + 169) (X<sup>2</sup> + 38X + 361) </p>", "options_en": ["(x + 13) (x  -  19)", "(x  -  13) (x  -  19)", "(x  -  13) (x + 19)", "(x + 13) (x + 19)"], "options_hi": ["(x + 13) (x  -  19)", "(x  -  13) (x  -  19)", "(x  -  13) (x + 19)", "(x + 13) (x + 19)"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>X<sup>2</sup> + 26X + 169 = 0</p><p>X<sup>2</sup> + 13X + 13X + 169 = 0</p><p>X (X + 13) + 13 (X + 13) = 0</p><p>(X + 13) (X + 13) = 0</p><p>X = -13, -13 </p><p>X<sup>2</sup> + 38X + 361 = 0</p><p>X<sup>2</sup> + 19X + 19X + 361 = 0</p><p>X (X + 19) + 19 (X + 19) = 0</p><p>(X + 19) (X + 19) = 0</p><p>X = -19, -19 </p><p>Hence, the square root = (x + 13) (x + 19)</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>X<sup>2</sup> + 26X + 169 = 0</p><p>X<sup>2</sup> + 13X + 13X + 169 = 0</p><p>X (X + 13) + 13 (X + 13) = 0</p><p>(X + 13) (X + 13) = 0</p><p>X = -13, -13 </p><p>X<sup>2</sup> + 38X + 361 = 0</p><p>X<sup>2</sup> + 19X + 19X + 361 = 0</p><p>X (X + 19) + 19 (X + 19) = 0</p><p>(X + 19) (X + 19) = 0</p><p>X = -19, -19 </p><p>Hence, the square root = (x + 13) (x + 19)</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If one of the roots of the equation X<sup>2</sup>  -  (P + 16) X + (P<sup>2</sup>  -  151) = 0 is 18, then find the value of P (P is a positive integer). </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; X<sup>2</sup> - (P + 16) X + (P<sup>2</sup> - 151) = 0 &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; 18 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; P &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; (P &#2319;&#2325; &#2343;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;)&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["23", "21", "27", "05"], "options_hi": ["23", "21", "27", "05"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Since 18 is a root of the given equation which means it will satisfy the equation. </p><p>X<sup>2</sup>  -  (P + 16) X + (P<sup>2</sup>  -  151) = 0</p><p>18<sup>2</sup>  -  (P + 16) * 18 + (P<sup>2</sup>  -  151) = 0</p><p>324  -  (P + 16) * 18 + (P<sup>2</sup>  -  151) = 0</p><p>324  -  18P  -  288 + P<sup>2</sup>  -  151 = 0</p><p>P<sup>2</sup>  -  18P  -  115 = 0</p><p>P<sup>2</sup>  -  23P + 5P  -  115 = 0</p><p>P (P  -  23) + 5 (P  -  23) = 0</p><p>(P + 5) (P  -  23) = 0</p><p>P = -5 and 23</p><p>Hence, P = 23</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Since 18 is a root of the given equation which means it will satisfy the equation. </p><p>X<sup>2</sup>  -  (P + 16) X + (P<sup>2</sup>  -  151) = 0</p><p>18<sup>2</sup>  -  (P + 16) * 18 + (P<sup>2</sup>  -  151) = 0</p><p>324  -  (P + 16) * 18 + (P<sup>2</sup>  -  151) = 0</p><p>324  -  18P  -  288 + P<sup>2</sup>  -  151 = 0</p><p>P<sup>2</sup>  -  18P  -  115 = 0</p><p>P<sup>2</sup>  -  23P + 5P  -  115 = 0</p><p>P (P  -  23) + 5 (P  -  23) = 0</p><p>(P + 5) (P  -  23) = 0</p><p>P = -5 and 23</p><p>Hence, P = 23</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If 5/2 is one of the roots of the quadratic equation (m + 1) X<sup>2</sup>  -  38X + (m<sup>2</sup>  -  4) = 0, then find the possible values of m. </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 5/2 &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2367;&#2328;&#2366;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; (m + 1) X<sup>2</sup> - 38X + (m<sup>2</sup> - 4) = 0 &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; m &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2349;&#2366;&#2357;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["-7, -53/4", "7, 53/4", "-7, 53/4", "7, -53/4"], "options_hi": ["-7, -53/4", "7, 53/4", "-7, 53/4", "7, -53/4"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Put X = 5/2 in the given equation </p><p>(m + 1) X<sup>2</sup>  -  38X + (m<sup>2</sup>  -  4) = 0 </p><p>(m + 1) (5/2)<sup>2</sup>  -  38 * 5/2 + (m<sup>2</sup>  -  4) = 0 </p><p>25m/4 + 25/4  -  190/2 + m<sup>2</sup>  -  4 = 0 </p><p>25m + 25  -  380 + 4m<sup>2</sup>  -  16 = 0 </p><p>4m<sup>2</sup> + 25m  -  371 = 0</p><p>4m<sup>2</sup> + 53m  -  28m  -  371 = 0 </p><p>m (4m + 53)  -  7(4m + 53) = 0</p><p>(4m +53) (m -7) = 0 </p><p>m = 7, - 53/4 </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Put X = 5/2 in the given equation </p><p>(m + 1) X<sup>2</sup>  -  38X + (m<sup>2</sup>  -  4) = 0 </p><p>(m + 1) (5/2)<sup>2</sup>  -  38 * 5/2 + (m<sup>2</sup>  -  4) = 0 </p><p>25m/4 + 25/4  -  190/2 + m<sup>2</sup>  -  4 = 0 </p><p>25m + 25  -  380 + 4m<sup>2</sup>  -  16 = 0 </p><p>4m<sup>2</sup> + 25m  -  371 = 0</p><p>4m<sup>2</sup> + 53m  -  28m  -  371 = 0 </p><p>m (4m + 53)  -  7(4m + 53) = 0</p><p>(4m +53) (m -7) = 0 </p><p>m = 7, - 53/4 </p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following quadratic equation has equal roots?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2367;&#2328;&#2366;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?</p>", "options_en": ["4x<sup>2</sup>  -  6x + 2 = 0", "4x<sup>2</sup> + 20x + 16 = 0", "9x<sup>2</sup>  -  6x + 1 = 0", "None of these"], "options_hi": ["4x<sup>2</sup> - 6x + 2 = 0", "4x<sup>2</sup> + 20x + 16 = 0", "9x<sup>2</sup> - 6x + 1 = 0", "&#2311;&#2344;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2379;&#2312; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306;"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>From (a): 4x<sup>2</sup>  -  6x + 2 = 0</p><p>4x<sup>2</sup>  -  4x  -  2x + 2 = 0</p><p>(4x  -  2)(x  -  1) = 0</p><p>x = 1/2, 1</p><p>From (b): 4x<sup>2</sup> + 20x + 16 = 0</p><p>4x<sup>2</sup> + 4x + 16x + 16 = 0</p><p>(4x + 16)(x + 1) = 0</p><p>x = -4, -1</p><p>From (c): 9x<sup>2</sup>  -  6x + 1 = 0</p><p>9x<sup>2</sup>  - 3x  -  3x + 1 = 0</p><p>(3x  -  1)(3x  -  1) = 0</p><p><b>x = 1/3, 1/3 (equal roots)</b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>From (a): 4x<sup>2</sup>  -  6x + 2 = 0</p><p>4x<sup>2</sup>  -  4x  -  2x + 2 = 0</p><p>(4x  -  2)(x  -  1) = 0</p><p>x = 1/2, 1</p><p>From (b): 4x<sup>2</sup> + 20x + 16 = 0</p><p>4x<sup>2</sup> + 4x + 16x + 16 = 0</p><p>(4x + 16)(x + 1) = 0</p><p>x = -4, -1</p><p>From (c): 9x<sup>2</sup>  -  6x + 1 = 0</p><p>9x<sup>2</sup>  - 3x  -  3x + 1 = 0</p><p>(3x  -  1)(3x  -  1) = 0</p><p><b>x = 1/3, 1/3 (equal roots)</b></p>"}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;&#945; and &#946; are roots of the equation x<sup>2</sup>  -  x + 4 = 0. What is the value of <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>&#945;</span></div> + <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>&#946;</span></div> &quest;&nbsp;</div></p><p></p>", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#945; &#2324;&#2352; &#946; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; x<sup>2</sup> - x + 4 = 0 &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2340;&#2379; <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>&#945;</span></div> + <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>&#946;</span></div> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</div></p>", "options_en": ["1/4", "5/4", "3/4", "7/4"], "options_hi": ["1/4", "5/4", "3/4", "7/4"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  x + 4 = 0</p><p>So, &#945; + &#946; = 1 and &#945;&#946; = 4</p><p>Now,</p><p>(1/&#945;) + (1/&#946;)</p><p>= (&#946; + &#945;)/(&#945; * &#946;)</p><p>= 1/4</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  x + 4 = 0</p><p>So, &#945; + &#946; = 1 and &#945;&#946; = 4</p><p>Now,</p><p>(1/&#945;) + (1/&#946;)</p><p>= (&#946; + &#945;)/(&#945; * &#946;)</p><p>= 1/4</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If (3x + 8) and (2x - 7) are the factors of Ax<sup>2</sup> + Bx + C, then find &#8731;(BC - A<sup>3</sup>)</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (3x + 8) &#2324;&#2352; (2x - 7) Ax<sup>2</sup> + Bx + C &#2325;&#2375; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2344;&#2326;&#2306;&#2337; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2340;&#2379; &#8731;(BC - A<sup>3</sup>) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["3", "4", "2", "1"], "options_hi": ["3", "4", "2", "1"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>(3x + 8)(2x - 7) = Ax<sup>2</sup> + Bx + C</p><p>=&gt; 6x<sup>2</sup>  -  5x  -  56 = Ax<sup>2</sup> + Bx + C</p><p>Hence, A = 6, B = -5, and C = -56</p><p>Thus,</p><p><img width=352 height=28 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19393/image011.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(3x + 8)(2x - 7) = Ax<sup>2</sup> + Bx + C</p><p>=&gt; 6x<sup>2</sup>  -  5x  -  56 = Ax<sup>2</sup> + Bx + C</p><p>Hence, A = 6, B = -5, and C = -56</p><p>Thus,</p><p><img width=352 height=28 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19393/image011.png\"></p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>The quadratic equation with rational coefficients having (4  -  &radic;3) as one of its roots is:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2350;&#2375;&#2351; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341;, &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; (4 - &radic;3) &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2319;&#2325; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2367;&#2328;&#2366;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["x<sup>2</sup>  -  16x + 9 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup>  -  13x + 8 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup>  -  8&radic;3x + 9 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup>  -  8x + 13 = 0"], "options_hi": ["x<sup>2</sup> - 16x + 9 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup> - 13x + 8 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup> - 8&radic;3x + 9 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup> - 8x + 13 = 0"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Let &#945; and &#946; be the roots of the required quadratic equation where &#945; = 4  -  &radic;3.</p><p>So, &#946; = 4 +&radic;3</p><p>&#945; + &#946; = 8</p><p>&#945;&#946; = 13</p><p>So, the equation is x<sup>2</sup>  -  (&#945; + &#946;)x + &#945;&#946; = 0</p><p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  8x + 13 = 0</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let &#945; and &#946; be the roots of the required quadratic equation where &#945; = 4  -  &radic;3.</p><p>So, &#946; = 4 +&radic;3</p><p>&#945; + &#946; = 8</p><p>&#945;&#946; = 13</p><p>So, the equation is x<sup>2</sup>  -  (&#945; + &#946;)x + &#945;&#946; = 0</p><p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  8x + 13 = 0</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>When two equations: 16x<sup>2</sup>  -  Ax + 49 = 0 and 4y<sup>2</sup>  -  By + 121 = 0 both have real and equal roots, then what is the value of &radic;(A + B) if both A and B are positive integers?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2332;&#2348; &#2342;&#2379; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339;: 16x<sup>2</sup> - Ax + 49 = 0 &#2324;&#2352; 4y<sup>2</sup> - By + 121 = 0 &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2357;&#2366;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2357;&#2367;&#2325; &#2324;&#2352; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; A &#2324;&#2352; B &#2343;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2350;&#2325; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2340;&#2379; &radic;(A + B) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["10", "11", "12", "8"], "options_hi": ["10", "11", "12", "8"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>16x<sup>2</sup>  -  Ax + 49 = 0</p><p>Since, the equation has real and equal roots.</p><p>b<sup>2</sup>  -  4ac = 0</p><p>(-A)<sup>2</sup> = 4 * 16 * 49</p><p>A = 2 * 4 * 7</p><p>A = 56</p><p>4y<sup>2</sup>  -  By + 121 = 0</p><p>Since, the equation has real and equal roots.</p><p>b<sup>2</sup>  -  4ac = 0</p><p>(-B)<sup>2</sup> = 4 * 4 * 121</p><p>B = 2 * 2 * 11</p><p>B = 44</p><p>Required answer = &radic;(A + B) = &radic;(56 + 44) = 10</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>16x<sup>2</sup>  -  Ax + 49 = 0</p><p>Since, the equation has real and equal roots.</p><p>b<sup>2</sup>  -  4ac = 0</p><p>(-A)<sup>2</sup> = 4 * 16 * 49</p><p>A = 2 * 4 * 7</p><p>A = 56</p><p>4y<sup>2</sup>  -  By + 121 = 0</p><p>Since, the equation has real and equal roots.</p><p>b<sup>2</sup>  -  4ac = 0</p><p>(-B)<sup>2</sup> = 4 * 4 * 121</p><p>B = 2 * 2 * 11</p><p>B = 44</p><p>Required answer = &radic;(A + B) = &radic;(56 + 44) = 10</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If &alpha; and &beta; are roots of x<sup>2</sup> - x - 1 = 0, then the equation whose roots are&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&alpha;</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">&beta;</span></div>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&beta;</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">&alpha;</span></div>&nbsp;is:&nbsp;</div></p><p></p>", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#945; &#2324;&#2352; &#946;, x<sup>2</sup> - x - 1 = 0 &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2357;&#2361; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&alpha;</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">&beta;</span></div>&#2324;&#2352;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&beta;</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">&alpha;</span></div> &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;:</div></p>", "options_en": ["x<sup>2</sup>  -  x + 1 = 0", "x<sup>2 </sup>+ 3x + 1 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup> - 3x + 1 = 0", "x<sup>2 </sup>+ x  -  1 = 0"], "options_hi": ["x<sup>2</sup> - x + 1 = 0", "x<sup>2 </sup>+ 3x + 1 = 0", "x<sup>2</sup> - 3x + 1 = 0", "x<sup>2 </sup>+ x - 1 = 0"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>We know, if &#945; and &#946; are roots of the equation ax<sup>2</sup> + bx + c, then</p><p>&#945; = -b/a and &#946; = c/a</p><p>In the given equation x<sup>2</sup>  -  x  -  1 = 0:</p><p>&#945; + &#946; = -(-1)/1 = 1</p><p>And &#945;&#946; = (-1)/1 = -1</p><p>Now, (&#945; + &#946;)<sup>2</sup> = &#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#946;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;&#946;</p><p>1<sup>2</sup> = &#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#946;<sup>2</sup> + 2 * (-1)</p><p>&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#946;<sup>2</sup> = 3</p><p>Then, &#945;/&#946; + &#946;/&#945; = (&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#946;<sup>2</sup>)/&#945;&#946; = 3/(-1) = -3</p><p>And &#945;/&#946; * &#946;/&#945; = 1</p><p>Therefore, the equation whose roots are -3 and 1 is:</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + (-3)x + 1 = 0</p><p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  3x + 1 = 0</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We know, if &#945; and &#946; are roots of the equation ax<sup>2</sup> + bx + c, then</p><p>&#945; = -b/a and &#946; = c/a</p><p>In the given equation x<sup>2</sup>  -  x  -  1 = 0:</p><p>&#945; + &#946; = -(-1)/1 = 1</p><p>And &#945;&#946; = (-1)/1 = -1</p><p>Now, (&#945; + &#946;)<sup>2</sup> = &#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#946;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;&#946;</p><p>1<sup>2</sup> = &#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#946;<sup>2</sup> + 2 * (-1)</p><p>&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#946;<sup>2</sup> = 3</p><p>Then, &#945;/&#946; + &#946;/&#945; = (&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#946;<sup>2</sup>)/&#945;&#946; = 3/(-1) = -3</p><p>And &#945;/&#946; * &#946;/&#945; = 1</p><p>Therefore, the equation whose roots are -3 and 1 is:</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + (-3)x + 1 = 0</p><p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  3x + 1 = 0</p>"}, {"q_en": "<div>&nbsp;If &#945;, &#946; are the roots of the equation 4x<sup>2</sup> + 3x + 2 = 0, then the value of&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&#945;<sup>2</sup></span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">&#946;</span></div>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&#946;<sup>2</sup></span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">&#945;</span></div>&nbsp;is = &quest;&nbsp;</div>", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#945;, &#946; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; 4x<sup>2</sup> + 3x + 2 = 0 &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; '?' &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2366; <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&#945;<sup>2</sup></span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">&#946;</span></div>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&#946;<sup>2</sup></span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">&#945;</span></div>= ?</div></p>", "options_en": ["45/16", "43/16", "45/32", "43/32"], "options_hi": ["45/16", "43/16", "45/32", "43/32"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>While comparing the given equation 4x<sup>2</sup> + 3x + 2 = 0 with standard quadratic equation ax<sup>2</sup> + bx + c = 0, we get</p><p>a = 4, b = 3, c = 2</p><p>Now, &#945; + &#946; = -b/a = -3/4</p><p>And &#945;&#946; = c/a = 2/4 = 1/2</p><p>Now, (&#945; + &#946;)<sup>3</sup> = &#945;<sup>3</sup> + &#946;<sup>3</sup> + 3&#945;&#946;(&#945; + &#946;)</p><p>(-3/4)<sup>3</sup> = &#945;<sup>3</sup> + &#946;<sup>3</sup> + 3(1/2)(-3/4)</p><p>&#945;<sup>3</sup> + &#946;<sup>3</sup>= -27/64 + 9/8</p><p>Therefore, &#945;<sup>2</sup>/&#946; + &#946;<sup>2</sup>/&#945;</p><p>= (&#945;<sup>3</sup> + &#946;<sup>3</sup>)/(&#945;&#946;)</p><p>= (-27/64 + 9/8)/(1/2)</p><p>= 45/32</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>While comparing the given equation 4x<sup>2</sup> + 3x + 2 = 0 with standard quadratic equation ax<sup>2</sup> + bx + c = 0, we get</p><p>a = 4, b = 3, c = 2</p><p>Now, &#945; + &#946; = -b/a = -3/4</p><p>And &#945;&#946; = c/a = 2/4 = 1/2</p><p>Now, (&#945; + &#946;)<sup>3</sup> = &#945;<sup>3</sup> + &#946;<sup>3</sup> + 3&#945;&#946;(&#945; + &#946;)</p><p>(-3/4)<sup>3</sup> = &#945;<sup>3</sup> + &#946;<sup>3</sup> + 3(1/2)(-3/4)</p><p>&#945;<sup>3</sup> + &#946;<sup>3</sup>= -27/64 + 9/8</p><p>Therefore, &#945;<sup>2</sup>/&#946; + &#946;<sup>2</sup>/&#945;</p><p>= (&#945;<sup>3</sup> + &#946;<sup>3</sup>)/(&#945;&#946;)</p><p>= (-27/64 + 9/8)/(1/2)</p><p>= 45/32</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If (2y  -  3) is a factor of my<sup>2</sup>  -  4my + n, then  -  </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (2y - 3), my<sup>2</sup> - 4my + n &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2344;&#2326;&#2306;&#2337; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; -</p>", "options_en": ["3m = 4n/5", "m = 2n/5", "5m = 2n/5", "m = n/15"], "options_hi": ["3m = 4n/5", "m = 2n/5", "5m = 2n/5", "m = n/15"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Factor = (2y-3)</p><p>Root = 3/2</p><p>my<sup>2</sup>  -  4my + n = 0</p><p>m(3/2)<sup>2</sup>  -  4m*(3/2) + n = 0</p><p>9m  -  24m + 4n = 0</p><p>15m  -  4n = 0 </p><p>m = 4n/15</p><p>3m = 4n/5</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Factor = (2y-3)</p><p>Root = 3/2</p><p>my<sup>2</sup>  -  4my + n = 0</p><p>m(3/2)<sup>2</sup>  -  4m*(3/2) + n = 0</p><p>9m  -  24m + 4n = 0</p><p>15m  -  4n = 0 </p><p>m = 4n/15</p><p>3m = 4n/5</p>"}]}